{
  "title": "API Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "API를 공개하고 요청을 Lambda·HTTP 백엔드 등에 전달한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#rest-apis\">REST APIs</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#http-apis\">HTTP APIs</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#websocket-apis\">WebSocket APIs</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#integrations-and-vpc-links\">Integrations and VPC Links</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#authorizers-and-iam-authorization\">Authorizers and IAM Authorization</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#throttling-usage-plans-and-caching\">Throttling, Usage Plans and Caching</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#stages-deployments-and-custom-domains\">Stages, Deployments and Custom Domains</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#cors-logging-and-errors\">CORS, Logging and Errors</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>03 / 62</span></div><h1>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Gateway</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 8 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Gateway는 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span>·REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span>·WebSocket API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>의 Front Door를 관리한다. 인증·Routing·Throttling·배포 Stage를 Backend와 연결해 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 운영 부담을 줄인다.</p><p>REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>, HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>, WebSocket API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>는 지원 기능과 비용이 다르다. API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Key·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#throttling-usage-plans-and-caching\">Usage Plan</a>·Caching·Private API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 같은 요구가 있으면 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 유형별 지원을 먼저 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"공개 API와 Private Backend\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>공개 API와 Private Backend</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>API request</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span></strong><small>Domain·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Gateway</strong><small>Authorizer·Route·Throttle</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> / HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> backend</strong><small>지원 Integration</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Private integration</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Gateway</strong><small>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Endpoint 유형 별도 선택</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#integrations-and-vpc-links\">VPC Link</a></strong><small>지원 Private 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Private backend</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>·Route·서비스 설정</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Backend가 Private인 것과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Endpoint 자체가 Private인 것은 다르다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">API</th><th scope=\"col\">Connection</th><th scope=\"col\">Typical requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span></td><td>Request / Response</td><td>풍부한 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 관리 기능</td></tr><tr><td>HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span></td><td>Request / Response</td><td>간결한 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> / JWT</td></tr><tr><td>WebSocket</td><td>Persistent bidirectional</td><td>Chat / Live updates</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"rest-apis\"><h2>REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span> APIs <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interfaces)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#rest-apis\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Resource·Method 중심 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>와 풍부한 관리 기능을 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#throttling-usage-plans-and-caching\">Usage Plan</a>·API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Key·지원 Cache·Request Validation 같은 요구에 비교한다. Edge-optimized·Regional·Private Endpoint 유형의 차이를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"http-apis\"><h2>HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> APIs <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interfaces)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#http-apis\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>간결한 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>와 낮은 비용·지연에 초점을 둔다. 지원 JWT Authorizer·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>·HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> Integration을 사용한다. REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>의 모든 관리 기능을 동일하게 제공하지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"websocket-apis\"><h2>WebSocket APIs <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interfaces)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#websocket-apis\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Client와 지속적인 양방향 연결을 유지한다. $connect·$disconnect·$default 및 Custom Route로 Message를 처리한다. Backend는 Connection ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>를 관리하고 지원 Management API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>로 Client에 응답한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"integrations-and-vpc-links\"><h2>Integrations and VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Links<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#integrations-and-vpc-links\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>·HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span>·AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Service 등 지원 Integration을 연결한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#integrations-and-vpc-links\">VPC Link</a>는 지원 Private Backend에 접근하는 경로다. API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 자체가 Private인 것과 Backend만 Private인 것은 다른 설계다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"authorizers-and-iam-authorization\"><h2>Authorizers and IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> Authorization<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#authorizers-and-iam-authorization\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> Signature, Cognito·JWT, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> Authorizer 등 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 유형별 인증을 선택한다. API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Key는 일반적인 사용자 인증·권한 시스템의 대체재가 아니다. 인증된 Identity가 어떤 Resource를 사용할지 Authorization도 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"throttling-usage-plans-and-caching\"><h2>Throttling, Usage Plans and Caching<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#throttling-usage-plans-and-caching\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Rate·Burst 제한으로 Backend를 보호한다. REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#throttling-usage-plans-and-caching\">Usage Plan</a>은 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Key별 사용 관리에, Cache는 지원 Response 재사용에 사용한다. Quota가 엄격한 과금 상한처럼 모든 초과 요청을 즉시 차단한다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"stages-deployments-and-custom-domains\"><h2>Stages, Deployments and Custom Domains<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#stages-deployments-and-custom-domains\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Stage로 dev·prod 같은 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 배포를 구분하고 Custom Domain·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a> Certificate를 연결한다. Canary 등 기능 지원은 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 유형별로 확인한다. Stage 설정과 Backend Version 전환을 함께 관리한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cors-logging-and-errors\"><h2>CORS <span class=\"full-name\">(Cross-Origin Resource Sharing)</span>, Logging and Errors<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#cors-logging-and-errors\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#cors-logging-and-errors\">CORS</a>는 Browser의 Cross-origin 요청 허용 정책이다. 서버 간 요청 인증이나 Backend Network 방화벽을 대신하지 않는다. Access Log·Metric·Trace와 적절한 Error Response로 운영 상태를 확인한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>JWT 인증이 필요한 간단한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>는 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 비교한다. API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Key별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#throttling-usage-plans-and-caching\">Usage Plan</a>·Response Cache가 필수라면 REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 지원을 확인한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a>은 역할이 다르다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/apigateway/latest/developerguide/welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">apigateway/latest/developerguide/welcome.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q071\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q077\" data-question=\"Q077\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q077</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A mobile application calls Lambda functions through an HTTPS API and needs authentication and request throttling. Which front-end service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon API Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a>는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 인증·제한 등을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q073\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q092\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q072\" data-question=\"Q072\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q072</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q072/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A worker receives an SQS message but fails before deleting it. What generally happens?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The message disappears permanently</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A new message is always inserted at the back of the queue</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The message automatically moves to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The message can be received again after the visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 메시지는 삭제 전까지 큐에 남고 숨김 시간이 끝나면 다시 보일 수 있다. 표준 큐에서는 순서를 가정하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">이전 용어 <b>AMI</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">다음 용어 <b>Aurora</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
